    "intro_narrative": "The relentless ash storms have finally settled, revealing the buried entrance to Outpost 31. You are a Scavenger, desperate to find the legendary override codes rumored to be hidden deep within this abandoned military bunker. The facility is pitch black, smelling strongly of ozone, rust, and decayed electronics. Your survival depends on reactivating the scattered remnants of old-world technology, piecing together forgotten access protocols, and securing the final sequence before your suit's air scrubbers fail completely. Every shadow hides a relic of the past, and every locked container stands between you and salvation. Time is running out as the ambient radiation levels slowly begin to rise.",
